shiftdeck uses ppt-master's SVG-to-DrawingML compilation engine, its Confirm UI
and live-preview surfaces, its icon libraries, and its visualization template
library. The engine is NOT redistributed in this repository; `scripts/setup.py`
retrieves the pinned version at install time. shiftdeck's own contributions are
additive and live under `overlay/`.

The MIT License text for ppt-master accompanies its own distribution and is
reproduced in vendor/ppt-master/LICENSE after installation.

